ignoff_required":false,"topics":["hacktoberfest","indentation","neovim","neovim-plugin","vim","vim-plugin"],"visibility":"public","forks":113,"open_issues":24,"watchers":4810,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Hello, I love the plugin!\r\n\r\nHowever, I found a case where it results in a segfault every time, and this has happened quite frequently.\r\n\r\nTo replicate, create a file, then place two statements in an indent, say two prints in a function like this:\r\n\r\n```python\r\n#example.py\r\ndef some_function(args):\r\n    print(\"stetement above\")\r\n\r\n    print(\"statement below\")\r\n```\r\n\r\nThen in normal mode place the cursor in the first print statement, press `o` to start writing below, then `enter` while in insert mode to go down one line further, then write some statement in the middle, enter normal mode, delete it with let's say: `dap` in normal mode, and then repeadetely press `u` for undo. This will result in a segfault right before the print statement is deleted.\r\n\r\n```python\r\n#example.py\r\ndef some_function(args):\r\n    print(\"stetement above followed by an empty line\")\r\n\r\n    print(\"This will segfault when undone\")\r\n\r\n    print(\"statement below preceded by an empty line\")\r\n```\r\n\r\nI tried to simplify the situation under which this occurs as much as I could, but this is as far as I got.\r\n\r\n`nvim --version`\r\n```\r\nNVIM v0.5.0-dev+1282-gfbe18d9ca\r\nBuild type: Release\r\nLuaJIT 2.1.0-beta3\r\nCompilation: /usr/bin/cc -U_FORTIFY_SOURCE -D_FORTIFY_SOURCE=1 -O2 -DNDEBUG -Wall -Wextra -pedantic -Wno-unused-parameter -Wstrict-prototypes -std=gnu99 -Wshadow -Wconversion -Wmissing-prototypes -Wimplicit-fallthrough -Wvla -fstack-protector-strong -fno-common -fdiagnostics-color=always -DINCLUDE_GENERATED_DECLARATIONS -D_GNU_SOURCE -DNVIM_MSGPACK_HAS_FLOAT32 -DNVIM_UNIBI_HAS_VAR_FROM -DMIN_LOG_LEVEL=3 -I/home/john/neovim/build/config -I/home/john/neovim/src -I/home/john/neovim/.deps/usr/include -I/usr/include -I/home/john/neovim/build/src/nvim/auto -I/home/john/neovim/build/include\r\nCompiled by root@John-Lap\r\n\r\nFeatures: +acl +iconv +tui\r\nSee \":help feature-compile\"\r\n\r\n   system vimrc file: \"$VIM/sysinit.vim\"\r\n  fall-back for $VIM: \"/usr/local/share/nvim\"\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd my plugin settings are:\r\n```\r\nvim.g.indent_blankline_show_trailing_blankline_indent = false\r\nvim.g.indent_blankline_use_treesitter = false\r\nvim.g.indent_blankline_char = '▏'\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf there's a way to help I'll try to do so.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lukas-reineke/indent-blankline.nvim/issues/100/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lukas-reineke/indent-blankline.nvim/issues/100/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/comments/830785288","html_url":"https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/14477#issuecomment-830785288","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/issues/14477","id":830785288,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgzMDc4NTI4OA==","user":{"login":"lukas-reineke","id":12900252,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTAwMjUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12900252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukas-reineke","html_url":"https://github.com/lukas-reineke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukas-reineke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukas-reineke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukas-reineke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukas-reineke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lukas-reineke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lu